@startuml
title TMFS019 Overview

box "Entity\nCommunication Service Provider (CSP)"
participant "Entity IT System\n(Solution)" as Entity
end box
box "Supplier"
participant "Supplier IT System\n(Solution)" as Supplier
end box

== 1. Browse Supplier Catalog / Entity's Intent Management (TMFS019-1) ==
Entity -> Supplier : 1.A Entity browse Suppliers' catalog
Entity -> Supplier : 1.B or... Entity expresses to Supplier its Business Intent

== 2. Entity / Supplier FrameworkAgreement Management (TMFS019-2 and TMFS019-3) ==
Entity <-> Supplier : Definition of FrameworkAgreement and ad hoc ProductOffering proposition (bundle)\nincluding definition of Business Model, Contractual Model,\nFinancial Model, Operational Model...

== 3. Partner/Suppliers' Stakeholders/Partner On-Boarding (TMFS019-4 and TMFS019-5) ==
Entity -> Supplier : 3.A Supplier On-board Entity's assets\n(Actors/Organization, Billing Account, ZTP for lifecycle management, ...)
Supplier -> Entity : 3.B Entity On-board Supplier's assets\n(Actors/Organization, Billing Account, ZTP for lifecycle management, ...)
@enduml
